<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1c1e21;max-width:640px">
  <p>
    A certificate was issued to authenticate a local operation as you &mdash; a <code>sudo</code>, a
    <code>su</code>, or another PAM-guarded command on the machine below.
  </p>
  <p>If you just ran that command and answered the prompt, this is it and there is nothing to do.</p>
  <p style="background:#fdeced;border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding:10px 14px;margin:0 0 18px">
    If you did not, someone completed a PAM authentication in your name. That means they were
    already at a shell on that machine. Tell whoever runs it.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b7280">Authentication</h3>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px">
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Authenticated as</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ join .Principals ", " }}</td></tr>
    {{ if or .LocalUsername .LocalHostname }}<tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Client reported</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .LocalUsername }}{{ if and .LocalUsername .LocalHostname }}@{{ end }}{{ .LocalHostname }}</td></tr>{{ end }}
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Requested from</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .SourceIP }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Issued at</td><td style="padding:4px 0">{{ datetime .IssuedAt }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Valid until</td><td style="padding:4px 0">{{ datetime .ExpiresAt }} (in {{ until .ExpiresAt }})</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px">
    The client-reported name above is whatever the client sent and is not proof of anything. The
    address is what the server observed.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b7280">Certificate</h3>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px">
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Serial</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .Serial }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Key ID</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .KeyID }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">For key</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .PublicKeyFingerprint }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Request ID</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .RequestID }}</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px">
    A PAM certificate authorizes one local operation and is deliberately short-lived. It is not an
    SSH login credential, and nothing here can be used to open a session.
  </p>

  {{ if .ServerURL }}<p style="font-size:13px">Your <a href="{{ .ServerURL }}/certs" style="color:#1d4ed8">certificate history</a>.</p>{{ end }}

  <p style="margin-top:28px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#9099a8;font-size:12px">
    You are receiving this because "PAM certificate issued" is enabled in your
    {{ if .ServerURL }}<a href="{{ .ServerURL }}/preferences" style="color:#6b7280">notification preferences</a>{{ else }}notification preferences{{ end }}.
    It is off by default; turn it off there if one message per sudo is more than you want.
  </p>
</div>
